UID:260527KQMw7s7kR0ihca3LdhV4sQ
DESCRIPTION:Welcome the spring season with a night under the stars on the 
 Miller House Lawn as we screen the beloved romantic comedy Pretty Woman—
 a film that holds special meaning for our Founder\, Rich Frank from his ti
 me at Disney Studios. Settle in vineyard-side and enjoy an evening of grea
 t wine\, cozy seating\, and classic cinema as Julia Roberts and Richard Ge
 re light up the screen.\n\n**Wine & Treats:**\n\nEnjoy pours of your favor
 ite Frank Family wines all evening long\, alongside movie theater–style 
 popcorn and an elevated candy bar.\n\n**Special Moment:**\n\nHear from Ric
 h Frank himself as he shares why this film is so meaningful to him and his
  career in the entertainment business.\n\n**Show Time:**\n\nGuest arrival 
 begins at 6:30 pm and the movie starts at sundown.\n\n**Seating:**\n\nRela
 x in Adirondack chairs or plush couch seating on the Miller House Lawn - n
 o need to bring your own.\n\n**Weather:**\n\nGuests are encouraged to dres
 s for a cool spring evening in Napa Valley. We recommend bringing a light 
 layer or blanket to stay comfortable as the sun sets. In the event of rain
 \, the movie night will be canceled in advance and all tickets will be ref
 unded.
LOCATION:Frank  Family Vineyards
URL:https://www.exploretock.com/frankfamilyvineyards/event/605549 
