UID:260511sM48m8scsEWazVu8sFoyLQ
DESCRIPTION:The Laugh Cellar presents: Headliner Comedian Cathy Ladman at 
 DeLoach Vineyards\n\nCathy Ladman is an award-winning stand-up comedian\, 
 writer\, and actress. She has appeared on *The Tonight Show* 10 times\, wi
 th Jimmy Fallon\, Jay Leno\, and Johnny Carson\, including the final two a
 nniversary shows of Johnny Carson’s *Tonight Show*. She has also appeare
 d six times on *The Late Late Show with Craig Ferguson*\, had her own HBO 
 *One Night Stand* special\, a Showtime special\, and numerous other televi
 sion comedy appearances. In addition\, she was a writer for the hit televi
 sion shows *Roseanne* and *Caroline in the City*.\n\nComplimentary parking
  on-site\n\nOutdoor event \n\nDoors 6:00pm  / Showtime 7:00pm\n\nAVAILAB
 LE FOR PURCHASE: \n\nA beautiful selection of wine and sparkling wine \n
