BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:We Rise and Dance at the General's Daughter- PRIDE DANCE PARTY
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260613T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260613T220000
UID:260525paO-9THRHUad_D7FQ8wkNw
DESCRIPTION:The Official Sonoma Valley Pride Dance: We Rise With PrideThe 
 Return of a Legend. The Reclamation of a Landmark.The General's Daughter i
 s coming alive once again.\n\nOn Saturday\, June 13th\, Sonoma Valley Prid
 e invites you to a historic moment in time. After years of being shuttered
  and kept from the public\, the iconic General's Daughter is throwing its 
 doors wide open to embrace a new era of inclusivity. We aren't just hostin
 g a party\; we are welcoming a beloved Sonoma institution back into the fo
 ld of our community.\n\nJoin us for an evening of legacy and radiating que
 er joy as we dance and celebrate this year's theme: &ldquo\;We Rise With P
 ride.&rdquo\;\n\nLive DJ: We are thrilled to feature Local DJ Mary Louise 
 of Posso. Posso has hyped crowds all over the globe and she'll be spinning
  a high-energy set to keep the night fresh and fabulous.The Wine: Your tic
 ket includes wine donated by two of Sonoma's most respected wineries: Pang
 loss Cellars and Winery Sixteen 600.The Eats: Sonoma favorite Costa's Taco
 s will be on-site with delicious food available for purchase.The Scene: Co
 nnect with friends old and new in a space that was once lost to us\, but i
 s now&mdash\;proudly&mdash\;ours again.Event Details:\n\nTickets: Your tic
 ket priced at $30 includes wine and helps pay for our events. Food is avai
 lable for purchaseThe Daughter is back. The Daughter is Out. And she's GAY
  again.\n\nStay tuned for more details as they become available. Space is 
 limited for this historic occasion&mdash\;don't miss your chance to be par
 t of the reclamation.\n\nWe can not wait to celebrate with you the histori
 c landmarks of the most pride filled 3 day weekend ever in Sonoma Valley\,
  along with the return of the beloved landmark of Sonoma Valley returning 
 to the fold of Sonoma Valley after a long absence. \n\nFor further details
 \, visit Sonomavalleypride.com\n\nHOST SPONSOR\n\nEVENT PRESENTED BY    EV
 ENT SPONSORS\n\n    
LOCATION:The General's Daughter
URL:https://mynorthbaytickets.ticketsauce.com/e/we-rise-and-dance-at-the-g
 enerals-daughter-pride-d?aff=cityspark
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
