BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Stringing Time - A Mantra Bead Workshop with Jennifer Mygatt Tatum
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260614T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260614T160000
UID:260610cbuK4_hrKEGksbKNFGt1-A
DESCRIPTION:STRINGING TIME: A MANTRA BEAD WORKSHOP The Collective Act of M
 aking Mantra Beads taught by Jennifer Mygatt Tatum Explore clay bead makin
 g and stringing as a collaborative art practice in this three-hour hands-o
 n workshop. Participants will shape clay beads\, co-create a shared mantra
  and take part in a collective stringing session. Emphasis is placed on ma
 terial exploration\, rhythm\, and process over perfection. Making as a ref
 lective and communal act. No prior experience is required. All materials a
 re provided. This workshop is offered multiple times-please register for a
 ny one session. Dates: Sunday 6/14/26 Time: 12 - 4pm Space is limited to 8
  participants Location: 429 1st St.\, Suite 260\, Petaluma\, CA 94952
