DESCRIPTION:Michael \\(Mike\\) Roa will present information about his new 
 book \\(An Introductory Field Guide to the Coast Redwoods\\) and his ongoi
 ng contributions to the North Bay Science Discovery Day.\n\nMike is a reti
 red school teacher. Since retiring\, he been involved in science and envir
 onmental education in a variety of ways\, including helping to organize th
 e North Bay Science Discovery Day\, volunteering with the Stewards of the 
 Coast and Redwoods and publishing a monthly science and environmental educ
 ation e-newsletter called The Grapevine.\n\nWhile a classroom teacher\, Mi
 ke and his students earned numerous science and environmental education aw
 ards. He is the author of several science education magazine articles and 
 books\, including the Environmental Science Activities Kit\, The Conifer C
 onnection\, Redwood Ed\, A Guide to the Side of the Sea\, The Coast Redwoo
 d – Sequoia sempervirens – A Primer\, and An Introductory Field Guide 
 to the Coast Redwoods.
