BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tequila & Mezcal Tasting
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260616T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260616T200000
UID:260522ei91EAtZFkeosnduZsEFXA
DESCRIPTION:Join us in the Red Bull Room at McNear’s for a special Te
 quila & Mezcal Tasting Night on Tuesday\, June 16\, 2026—an elevated ev
 ening of bold flavors\, premium spirits\, and expertly paired cuisine. Thi
 s curated experience features standout pours including G4 Blanco and Repos
 ado Tequilas\, ArteNOM 1146 Añejo\, Palomo Espadín Mezcal\, and Las Mar
 ías Salmiana Mezcal\, each thoughtfully paired with a five-course chef-dr
 iven menu.\n\nFrom Brentwood corn esquites with chicharron and halibut agu
 achile with habanero-pineapple salsa\, to a bone-in pork chop al pastor an
 d a decadent Oaxacan sundae with mezcal float\, every course is designed t
 o complement and enhance the tasting journey.\n\nWith limited seating in a
 n intimate setting\, this is a one-night-only experience for those who app
 reciate exceptional food and world-class agave spirits.\n\nCost per person
  includes tax and gratuity.\n\nMENU-\n\n1st Course\n\nChicharron \n\nBren
 twood corn esquites\, BBQ\, epazote\, queso cotija\, cilantro aioli\n\n2nd
  Course\n\nHalibut Aqua Chili \n\nHabanero \\+ pineapple salsa\, tostada
  crisp\, avocado puree\, pickled onion\, radish\, mandarin\n\n3rd Course\n
 \nLA Wedge\n\nBaby iceberg\, chili spiced bacon\, heirloom tomato\, queso 
 fresco\, crispy onion\, chives\, jalapeno buttermilk dressing\n\n4th Cou
 rse\n\nPork Chop Pastor\n\nBone in achiote pork chop\, charred pineapple\,
  Pt Reyes toma grits\, asparagus ala plancha\, pork \\+ pineapple jus\n\n
 5th Course\n\nOaxacan Sundae\n\nValley Ford salted caramel soft serve\, ch
 urro cumble\, mango\, passion fruit mezcal float\, black lime salt
LOCATION:Mystic Theatre - Red Bull Room\, Red Bull Room Petaluma
URL:https://wl.eventim.us/event/tequila-and-mezcal-tasting/690469?afflky=M
 ysticTheatre
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
