 he Lounge at Mercy for a special edition of Sonoma County Pride Tokes & Jo
 kes headlined by the hilarious Marcus Williams.\n\nA Bay Area favorite\, M
 arcus is known for his razor-sharp wit and his “double life” as a stru
 ctural engineer by day and stand-up killer by night. He’s lit up stages 
