BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Broadway Under the Stars - Ain't Too Proud: The Life and Times of 
 the Temp.
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260619T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260619T220000
UID:260330IY0-YIvzpkOfJtxbEQ2u0A
DESCRIPTION:Ain’t Too Proud is the Tony-winning\, electrifying musical 
 that follows The Temptations’ extraordinary journey from the streets of 
 Detroit to the Rock & Roll Hall of Fame. Featuring their signature dance m
 oves and unforgettable harmonies\, this musical takes audiences behind the
  music: how the group formed\, the unprecedented chart-topping success the
 y achieved \\(42 Top Ten hits\, 14 \\#1 singles\\)\, and the personal and 
 political tensions that threatened their unity during a turbulent era in A
 merica.\n\nThis thrilling story of brotherhood\, family loyalty and betray
 al is set to the beat of the group’s treasured hits\, including “My Gi
 rl\,” “Just My Imagination\,” “Get Ready\,” “Papa Was a Rollin
 g Stone” and so many more\, with a book by award-winning playwright Domi
 nique Morisseau \\(Skeleton Crew\, Paradise Blue\\) adapted from Williams
 ’s 1988 memoir. The New York Times praised the show as\, “Pretty clos
 e to perfect”\, with The Washington Post proclaiming it was “Dazzling 
 and Electrifying.”\n\nAin’t Too Proud is presented through special ar
 rangement with Music Theatre International \\(MTI\\). All authorized perfo
 rmance materials are also supplied by MTI. www.mtishows.com\n\nMusic Thea
 tre International gives Ain’t Too Proud: The Life and Times of the Tempt
 ations a PG13 rating. This production is a gritty\, authentic look at the
  history of The Temptations. Parental discretion is advised.
LOCATION:Sonoma Field of Dreams
URL:https://www.pressdemocrat.com/events/#/details/broadway-under-the-star
 s-ain-t-too-proud-the-life-and-times-of-the-temp/18460828/2026-06-19T19
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Zak Fennie
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260619T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260619T000000
UID:260327uNkSgjetW0GzJC_7MxNKGA
DESCRIPTION:Zak Fennie is a singer–songwriter who has spent over a decad
 e igniting stages across the Bay Area with his voice\, his songs\, and gen
 uine connection to his audience.\n\nRooted in the Napa Valley\, Zak’s ca
 reer began as a busker and has since grown into a steady presence on stage
 s and festivals across the entire West Coast\, all driven by the same comm
 itment to his songwriting craft and the human spirit.\n\nZak’s music is 
 forged in the crucible of real life\, shaped by the stories he’s carried
 \, the lessons he’s learned\, and the people who continue to inspire him
 . \n\nWhether performing solo or with his full band\, Zak Fennie & Friends
 \, he brings the same heart\, focus\, and lifelong dedication to every sho
 w.
LOCATION:Merryvale Vineyards
URL:https://www.bandsintown.com/e/108069276?app_id=pkvts0on0m&came_from=28
 7&utm_medium=api&utm_source=partner_api&utm_campaign=event
