DESCRIPTION:Every Friday from May 22 through July 31\, Kosta Browne is ope
 ning their courtyard with wines by the glass. Enjoy that stretch of light 
 that lingers. See where the night takes you. It all begins here.\n\nKosta 
 Browne crafts Pinot Noir and Chardonnay from the wild edges of California
 ’s coast and the revered hillsides of Burgundy. The courtyard in Sebasto
 pol’s Barlow is where those wines get opened.
LOCATION:Kosta Browne Winery
URL:https://www.exploretock.com/kostabrowne/experience/603315/golden-hour-
 at-kosta-browne
