DESCRIPTION:Long-Time Residents Tell Tales from 1976\n\nJoanne Taeuffer wi
 th Guest Speakers\n\nHear about our town 50 years ago from a few people wh
 o remember it well. Joanne will interview long-time residents who share th
 eir memories of the economic and business environment\, the changes in the
  wine industry\, the foundation of the Healdsburg Museum and Historical So
 ciety\, the high school band and more. And then we’ll ask audience membe
 rs to share their stories.
