DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260620T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260620T203000
UID:260521DcbU_7aFoEitoUw_7WSZLA
DESCRIPTION:Join a hands-on coastal foraging experience exploring the rich
  variety of edible and medicinal seaweeds found along the Sonoma Coast. Le
 d by Autumn Summers and Ricardo Romero Gianoli\, participants will learn h
 ow to identify\, harvest\, and sustainably gather local seaweeds while exp
 loring the shoreline where ocean and land meet. Guests may harvest up to 1
 0 pounds of seaweed to take home and enjoy while discovering how coastal c
 ommunities have used seaweed for food\, wellness\, and gardening throughou
 t history. The experience also includes community-building activities and 
 concludes with a cooking demonstration featuring several seaweed varieties
 \, offering inspiration for using these ocean ingredients at home.
LOCATION:The California
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/seaweed-foraging-sonoma-coast-in-bodega-b
 ay/2026-06-20/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
