BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Seaweed Foraging on the Sonoma Coast
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260620T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260620T114500
UID:260528JRLYC0e3r0i5iGfICICioA
DESCRIPTION:This 2.5 hour guided morning foray will meet on the Sonoma Coa
 st\, and be followed by a talk on what you collected\, the ecology of seaw
 eed\, and how to cook your harvest. You can expect to collect up to 10 lbs
 . of raw edible seaweed. This is a coastal forage during low tide. You won
 't need to get in the ocean\, but we recommend wearing rain boots. Please 
 note this event is for ages 9 and up. An educational hands-on workshop · 
  Learn a new food skill ·  Explore the normally-underwater inter tidal 
 zone at a negative low tide ·  Connect with your local food system ·  
 Enjoy nutritional-rich umami direct from the source.
LOCATION:Bodega Bay
URL:https://www.foragesf.com/seaweed-foraging-sonoma
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Bricoleur Vineyards Essentials Picnic
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260620T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260620T153000
UID:260508BOfAV3tm3Em3nfG0DNhaHA
DESCRIPTION:Bricoleur Vineyards’ beloved Essentials Picnic pairs a b
 ottle of wine with charcuterie\, presented in a quintessential wicker bask
 et and a chic red wagon\, offering a relaxed and beautifully curated alfre
 sco wine country experience. Guests can enjoy their picnic in picturesque\
 , family- and dog-friendly settings across the estate—whether on the Pav
 ilion lawn\, beneath the trellis by the pond\, or at the picnic tables nes
 tled within the culinary and rose gardens. With exceptional wines\, thou
 ghtfully crafted foods\, and sweeping vistas\, a visit to Bricoleur Vin
 eyards offers a laid-back\, family-friendly atmosphere featuring lawn ga
 mes\, board games\, scavenger hunts\, and catch-and-release fishing.
LOCATION:Bricoleur Vineyard
URL:https://bricoleurvineyards.com/pages/visit?srsltid=AfmBOoq4MRc2MHal1tH
 0HwUmLbCHlVrPlsnizqNwrRFitw3UKui4rRJV
