BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Santa Rosa Original Certified Farmers Market
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260620T000000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260620T000000
UID:260606TgoJjQTp20ibawcJKHhmSQ
DESCRIPTION:The Santa Rosa Original Certified Farmers Market is a year-rou
 nd Saturday tradition in Sonoma County\, bringing together local farmers\,
  ranchers\, food artisans\, and neighbors from 8:30 a.m. to 1 p.m. This is
  not just a place to shop\, it's a place to connect directly with the peop
 le who grow your food. As a Slow Food Sonoma County award recipient\, the 
 market prioritizes integrity\, seasonality\, and true farm-to-community re
 lationships. Expect peak-season produce harvested just hours before market
 \, pasture-raised meats\, fresh flowers\, artisan breads\, handcrafted goo
 ds\, and thoughtfully prepared foods that reflect the region's agricultura
 l richness. Visitors can stroll the vibrant open-air market\, sample local
  flavors\, and experience Sonoma County's food culture in its most authent
 ic form. Families\, chefs\, and weekend explorers alike gather here to dis
 cover what's growing now and to support small farms that keep our local fo
 od system strong. Open every Saturday\, rain or shine\, the Santa Rosa Ori
 ginal Certified Farmers Market is a cornerstone of the community and a mus
 t-visit stop for anyone wanting to taste\, shop\, and experience Sonoma Co
 unty at its freshest.
LOCATION:Luther Burbank Center for the Arts
URL:https://www.visitsantarosa.com/events/#jlupcoming-events
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:TAKE YOUR TIME: Oil Pintings by Sharon Eisley
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260621T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260621T170000
UID:260529UDPXkGiru0i8-EMyXXnnhg
DESCRIPTION:“Take Your Time”\n\nChange and transformation take time. I
 n her newest oil paintings Sharon Eisley explores the time as a process. B
 e it moving through grief\, re-framing your story of self\, or birthing so
 me new creation\, each painting lures you in with beautiful application th
 en holds you in time for a closer examination of our human experience. Eis
 ley's paintings are all inspired by tarot cards and her personal journey. 
 Tarot readings will be offered at the reception by @SymbolWarehouse for an
  optional small donation.\n\nOur guest artist\, Robert Benson\, will be ch
 allenging your eyes to fill in the details with his impressionist watercol
 ors.\n\nThis June 20th reception will be the FINAL art opening for Sebasto
 pol Gallery in its home of almost 20 years! This show may last only throug
 h June 2026\, then move to our new location. Or it may be up through June 
 and July. Either way\, this will be your last chance to come celebrate our
  local\, amazing group of artists at 150 N Main St.. “Take Your Time” 
 is a reminder to our collective to take our time finding and setting up ou
 r new home for all of you. I hope you can all come celebrate all the time 
 and art we shared with you in our lovely gallery.\n\nwww.sharoneisley.com
LOCATION:Sebastopol Gallery
URL:http://sebastopolgallery.com
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
