  5:30 pm. Doors open 5:00 pm for the public. Members gain VIP entry 30 min
 utes earlier at 4:30 pm! Ellie James & the Electric Dream opens this seaso
 n's Luther Locals Live free outdoor concert series next Tuesday. Don't mis
 s this festive\, summer event\, where we make it all about great music\, f
 amily fun\, and dancing on the big green lawn. Every Tuesday\, enjoy the l
 ocal bands you love\, plus local eats\, craft beers\, and Rodney Strong Vi
 neyards wines. Ample parking on site. IDs checked at the bar. For the safe
 ty and comfort of all our patrons\, animals are not allowed except service
  animals. For more information on each artist\, please visit our website
