UID:260525p2dWMB2Gs0674sON_OEq0g
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a hands-on workshop where you'll learn the simple\
 , rewarding art of making floral bouquets. Sonoma County's summer blooms d
 o most of the work-with their vibrant colors and natural beauty-while you 
