 :30-8:30 PM and settle in for a night of fantastic music with delicious fo
 od and wine available as well. Join us for a memorable season of music\, f
 un\, and community spirit! Tonight's performance is by Aqua Nett. Enjoy po
 urs by Storybook Mountain Vineyards and Spence Vineyards. Tonight's featur
 ed non-profit is the Boys and Girls Club. Be sure to stop by their booth t
