  to 9:45am at lululemon\, located at 2307 Magowan Drive. Our 45-min instru
 ctor-led strength training class combines weights\, bands\, body-weight ex
 ercises\, and cardio at a quicker pace to sculpt and tone your muscles! Cl
 asses are set to killer playlists\, driven by the beat of the music. Mats 
 and equipment will be provided\, so just show up and be ready to work! Scu
 lpt 45 is suitable for all fitness levels\, and the instructor is always h
 appy to provide modifications as needed.\n\nSpace is limited\, and advance
