DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260627T113000
UID:260606WaP7JS_waUKVH0_q2AFjtA
DESCRIPTION:Teachers\, Text Books and School Spirit\n\nSchools have long b
 een of key importance in Healdsburg. Steve Deas will look at the early day
 s of education\, when farm kids got their basic education in one-room coun
 try school houses and the Seventh Day Adventist community established a co
 llege that sat near the center of town. Then he'll talk about more modern 
 schools and their importance in the community. And we'll ask the audience 
 to share stories of favorite teachers\, classroom hijinks and school spiri
 t.
LOCATION:Healdsburg Plaza Gazebo
URL:https://www.healdsburgmuseum.org/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
