 ican sounds of the 1960s and early '70s. Voted Best Reggae Band in the Nor
 th Bay by readers of the North Bay Bohemian\, Dan Martin and his 7-piece b
 and are guaranteed to move your feet and lift your spirits.\n\nThis is wha
 t our stage was built for: great artists\, beautiful afternoons\, and the 
