BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Flynn Creek Circus - The Cricket and the Wren
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260627T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260627T220000
UID:260529nBn4570jf0q6pQQi6ENLBw
DESCRIPTION:Flynn Creek Circus Presents ‘The Cricket & the Wren’: a hi
 ghly original\, all-human circus that enchants through breathtaking acroba
 tics and athletically stunning skill. Sponsored by the City of Rohnert Par
 k.\n\n**Rohnert Park\, CA— June 18 - June 28**– This 2026 season\, Fly
 nn Creek Circus invites audiences to ‘*The Cricket & the Wren’* — me
 morable family fun and Artful athleticism under the circus big top.\n\nA m
 erchant’s daughter sets out to find the castle where the horizon meets t
 he sea. In order to  break the spell of the Frog Prince\, she must brave 
 a harrowing journey filled with wonder.\n\nAlong the adventure\, she encou
 nters Jack and the Beanstalk’s sassy cow\, an out of pocket Pirate and t
 he secret sacrifice of the cricket and the wren. \n\nFeaturing aerialists
 \, jugglers\, knife throwers\, and laugh out loud comedy\, this circus ble
 nds classic storybook archetypes with imaginative new heroes. **The Cricke
 t and the Wren** will surprise\, dazzle and delight all ages. \n\nIn addi
 tion to the family friendly showings\,  and the interactive children's ca
 mp program held under the circus big top\,  Flynn Creek Circus also prese
 nts the wildly popular 'Adults Only Show' boasting outrageous acts\, dark 
 comedy\, and an infamous party atmosphere. Check the website for select ad
 ults only showtimes as well as special discount nights.\n\nSpectators for 
 all showings are invited to the tent to experience the magic up to 30 minu
 tes before each show. The event will offer beer\, wine\, and light concess
 ion for purchase and include a 15 minute intermission during the two hour 
 show.\n\n**Limited free parking** is available at 500 City Center Drive. P
 atrons should then cross the street in the pedestrian crossing at the Rohn
 ert Park Expressway and State Farm Drive traffic signal.\n\nTickets for Fl
 ynn Creek Circus are now available for purchase online at flynncreekcircus
 .com. Individual ticket prices start at $27 or\, for table reservations\, 
 options start at $98 for two attendees. \n\nFind showtimes and more detai
 ls on the camp programs for ages 5-8 and 7-15 at flynncreekcircus.com\n\nE
 arly booking is encouraged for this highly anticipated event. \n\n**Locat
 ion:** *SE corner lot at Rohnert Park Expressway and State Farm Dr. Rohner
 t Park\, CA 94928* *Under the circus big top*\n\nFor more information\, pr
 ess inquiries\, or interview requests\, please contact Stella Perry at mar
 keting@flynncreekcircus.com. High-resolution images and media resources ar
 e also available upon request\n\n**About Flynn Creek Circus:**Flynn Creek 
 Circus is an original\, modern circus company touring across the Pacific N
 orthwest\, delighting audiences with world-class acrobatics\, storytelling
 \, and comedy. Known for its innovative productions and intimate tent show
 s\, the company redefines the traditional circus experience
LOCATION:Under the circus big top
URL:https://flynncreekcircus.ticketspice.com/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:ICAEBT-2026
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260627T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260627T090000
UID:260529m_ZKDGKM6kq7y2u5c9vk8A
DESCRIPTION:The International Conference on Interdisciplinary Innovations:
  Arts\, Education\, Business and Technology (ICAEBT-2026) is a global hybr
 id event designed to bridge the gap between creative expression\, academic
  research\, and industrial advancement.\n\nHosted by IFERP Academy\, the c
 onference serves as a platform for researchers\, educators\, and industry 
 leaders to discuss how integrating these diverse fields can drive societal
  progress.
LOCATION:Copperfield's Books- Petaluma
URL:https://www.iferp.in/icaebt/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
