DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260628T113000
UID:260528Gw-5fJ_T-UWMBOUVJx52pQ
DESCRIPTION:Salsa & Mimosas: A Women-Only Sunday Morning Social \n\nUnwin
 d\, move\, and connect! Join us at Salsa Dance Marin for the perfect ble
 nd of rhythm and refreshment. Get your body moving and your spirits high j
 ust in time for the weekend wrap-up.\n\nNo experience needed. This event i
 s all about fun\, community\, and treating yourself.\n\nEvent Details\n\n
 • Date: Sunday\, June 28\n\n• Time: 10:00 AM – 11:30 AM\n\n• Loc
 ation: Salsa Dance Marin 4140 Redwood Hwy\, Suite 8\, San Rafael\, CA\n\
 nWhat to Expect\n\n• 10:00 AM – 11:00 AM | Lively Salsa Class: Shake 
 off the week with a one-hour introductory salsa lesson. Our instructor wil
 l guide you through the basic steps\, turns\, and rhythm—no partner or p
 revious experience required!\n\n• 11:00 AM – 11:30 AM | Mimosas & Ming
 ling: After working up a sweat\, reward yourself! Sip on crisp\, refreshi
 ng mimosas while chatting and connecting with an incredible community of l
 ocal women.\n\nGood to Know\n\n• What to wear: Comfortable clothes you 
 can easily move in\, and shoes that allow you to spin and dance comfortabl
 y.\n\n• Who it’s for: This event is strictly Women Only. Grab your b
 est friends\, your sisters\, or come solo to meet new friends!\n\nReserve 
 Your Spot\n\nSpace is limited to ensure everyone has plenty of room on the
  dance floor.
LOCATION:Salsa Dance Marin
URL:https://salsadancemarin.com/salsa-and-mimosa/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
