UID:2606127-O7qOs6P0imPdJNn0ur9A
DESCRIPTION:For June\, we'll be printing our own tea towels using fruits a
 nd vegetables! Are you interested in learning new crafts? Working on setti
 ng and meeting new goals? Meeting other like-minded people and making new 
 friends? Welcome to the Crafters Society! The Crafters Society is a new\, 
 monthly craft club specifically aimed at adults between the ages of 18-35 
 who are interested in flexing their creative muscles\, setting new goals\,
  and looking to approach life more mindfully. Each monthly session will in
 clude a themed craft project\, opportunities to reflect on new and past go
 als\, and time to socialize and meet new people. Come join us on this crea
 tive adventure! We look forward to meeting you! Registration encouraged\; 
 limited supplies available.
LOCATION:Northwest Santa Rosa Library
