DESCRIPTION:Price: Five-Day Fun Pass $85\, Any Day Ticket $30\n\nTicket In
 fo: https://tickets.marincenter.org/eventperformances.asp?evt=457\n\nLink:
  https://marinfair.org/\n\nStars\, Stripes and Stories\n\nJul y 1 - 5\n\n1
 1am-11pm\n\nNo entry after 10pm.\n\nThe Ma rin County Fair is a one price 
 gate. All prices include all live entertainment\, including headline conce
 rts on the Island Stage\\*\, 28 carnival rides\, spectacular nightly firew
 orks\, and exciting exhibits and experi ences you can only find at the Mar
 in County Fair.\n\n\\* Access to the Island Tent begins at 6pm each night 
 and at 2pm on July 4 . The Island may be closed if capacity is reached\, b
 ut additional concert viewing is available on the adjacent Special Events 
 Lawn. All access is on a first-come\, first-served basis for seating and s
 tan ding room on the Island.\n\nBuy a Five-Day Fun Pass and save! Makes a 
 great holiday gift!\n\nFrom November 28 through April 30\, the only way to
  secure discounted tickets to the Marin County Fair is to purchase a Five-
 Day Fun Pass. The Pass provides admission t o all five days of the Fair fo
 r only $85 \\(a 35% discount\\) plus you will receive a Marin County Fair 
 clear tote bag.\n\nBeginning Novem ber 28 and through the Fair\, you can p
 urchase an Any Day Ticket\, granting you admission to the Fair any single 
 day of your choice including July 4 for $30.\n\nIf you are looking for dis
 counted tickets\, we have two great options:\n\n• From November 28 throu
 gh April 30 \, you can purchase a Five-Day Fun Pass for just $85 \\(a disc
 ount of over 35%\\)\n\n• From May 1 through June 30\, you can purchase a
  Select Day Ticket for any specified day\, other than July 4\, for just $2
 0\n\nS pecial Admissions\n\nWednesday\, July 1\n\nAges 12 and under FREE\n
 \nAges 65 and over FREE\n\nVeterans with ID FREE\n\nDaily\n\nChildren 3 an
 d under FREE\n\nActive-duty military FREE\n\nAll tickets are final sale. N
 o refunds or exchanges.\n\nTicket policies: All Fair tickets may be purcha
 sed online 24/7. Tickets may also be purchased at the Marin Center Box Off
 ice when open for other events. Tickets are valid only on the day\\(s\\) f
 or which they were issued and cannot be exchanged for an alternate day or 
 refunded. There are NO ticketing kiosks at the gates\; a QR code to purcha
 se tickets will be posted at all entry points. All Fair tickets include ge
 neral admission to the headline concerts on a first-come\, first-served ba
 sis. All ticket sales are final. No refunds or exchanges.
LOCATION:Fairgrounds
URL:https://marinfair.org/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
