BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:SCREAM at Fun Size Blasted Art Gallery
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260703T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260703T200000
UID:2606129vjXIHaQAEWErE_8a8e78w
DESCRIPTION:Twelve Sonoma County artists will “SCREAM” together in a m
 iniature exhibit. The exhibit\, as well as every individual artwork in the
  show share the same title: SCREAM.\n\nThe miniature FUN SIZE Blasted Art 
 Gallery\, which measures 16 x 33 x 21”\, serves as a portable vessel for
  this chorus of artists\, was created as a timely response to global\, nat
 ional\, local\, and personal issues.\n\nThese artists will be SCREAMing to
 gether: Arminée Chahbazian\, Art Moura\, Bill Shelley\, Britta Kathmeyer\
 , Carlos Perez\, Chris Beards\, Jennifer Mygatt Tatum\, Kathleen Youngquis
 t\, Keviette Minor\, Kristen Throop\, Nick Mancillas\, and Nicole Mathers.
 \n\nThe Friday\, July 3\, Opening Reception is at the Santa Rosa Arts Cent
 er in the SOFA Arts District \\(312 South A Street\, Santa Rosa\\) at 5-8p
 m\, coinciding with SOFA Arts District First Friday.  \n\nSCREAM and FUN
  SIZE Blasted Art Gallery are a project of Blasted Art Gallery \\(Santa Ro
 sa artists Chris Beards & Bill Shelley\\)\, which presented gallery exhibi
 ts featuring Sonoma County artists from 2017 to 2019 in the SOFA Arts Dist
 rict in Santa Rosa\, and online in 2020.
LOCATION:Santa Rosa Arts Center
URL:https://www.pressdemocrat.com/events/#/details/scream-at-fun-size-blas
 ted-art-gallery/19154813/2026-07-03T17
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
