BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:3rd of July Fireworks & Music Extravaganza
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260703T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260703T220000
UID:2606100eC80dkNhECJlSitFiMfxQ
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Independence Day the West County way at the 53rd Ann
 ual Sebastopol Kiwanis 3rd of July Fireworks & Music Extravaganza on Frida
 y\, July 3\, 2026. This beloved hometown tradition returns bigger and bett
 er at the Sebastopol Community Cultural Center — bringing together thous
 ands of locals and visitors for an unforgettable evening of music\, food\,
  fun\, and fireworks. The festivities kick off at 4:00 PM with live music 
 on three stages featuring Contigo\, The Musers\, The New Sky Band\, and a 
 DJ after-party. Stroll the grounds for delicious food trucks\, a full beer
  and wine garden\, and the popular Kid’s Corner with games\, a bounce ho
 use\, dunk tank\, and family-friendly activities. Kids of all ages will lo
 ve the festive atmosphere as the sun sets over the scenic West Sonoma Coun
 ty hills. Premium Seating is available inside the Community Cultural Cente
 r with special perks and parking. As darkness falls\, the sky lights up wi
 th a spectacular professional fireworks display launched at approximately 
 9:30 PM. This dazzling show has been a cherished Sonoma County tradition f
 or more than five decades\, presented by the Kiwanis Club of Sebastopol. A
 ll proceeds support the Kiwanis Club’s mission to fund local scholarship
 s\, youth programs\, and community service projects throughout Sebastopol 
 and beyond. Bring your blankets\, lawn chairs\, and the whole family for a
  safe\, festive\, and patriotic night that truly captures the spirit of co
 mmunity and celebration.
LOCATION:Sebastopol Community Cultural Center
URL:https://www.sebastopolkiwanisclub.org/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:2026 Windsor KABOOM Fireworks Show
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260703T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260703T220000
UID:260527LVySQfwFPUqdtMhmie-tKw
DESCRIPTION:**Join the Town of Windsor and the Active 20-30 Club to celebr
 ate our nation’s Independence Day on July 3\, 2026\, at Keiser Park in W
 indsor\, CA!**\n\nCome celebrate Independence Day 2026 in style with the T
 own of Windsor and the Active 20-30 Club at Keiser Park! Get ready for an 
 explosive night of live music\, delicious food\, and endless fun for the w
 hole family. Don't miss out on the must-see fireworks event of the year th
 at directly benefits local children's programs through the Active 20-30 Cl
 ub.\n\n**And it’s all for the kids!** Not only are the fireworks a great
  event for kids of all ages\, but the proceeds of this event will directly
  benefit local children’s programs in partnership with the Active 20-30 
 Club. We hope to see you there!\n\nLive Music by:\n\n**DJ | Dry Creek Stat
 ion | Joose**\n\nBrought to you by the Active 20-30 Club
LOCATION:Keiser Park
URL:https://mynorthbaytickets.com/e/2026-windsor-kaboom-fireworks-show
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Wine Tails Trail at Cuvaison Winery
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260703T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260703T170000
UID:260508TaQaXJ2NjU211GdNpCH16g
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy a new way to experience Cuvaison with your canine compan
 ion on the Wine Tails Trail. This self-guided vineyard walk winds just und
 er a mile through our Los Carneros estate\, with QR code stops highlightin
 g the history of our vines and winemaking. Guests begin their adventure by
  checking in with our Concierge for a map and orientation before setting o
 ff on the trail.\n\nAfter the walk\, return to the estate and enjoy a seat
 ed tasting of our current release wines\, while your pup relaxes by your s
 ide and enjoys a selection of “Barkuterie.” The Wine Tails Trail is a 
 chance to stretch your legs\, explore the vineyard\, and savor Cuvaison in
  the company of your best friend.\n\nWhen booking this experience\, please
  plan for the dog walk to begin at the time you select. The walk itself av
 erages about 45 minutes\, though you’ll also check in with our Concierge
  before and after\, as well as complete a quick waiver at the start. Your 
 wine tasting will be scheduled 60 minutes after your selected walk time\, 
 allowing a smooth transition from the trail back to your seated experience
 .\n\nGroup Size: Up to 4 guests\, including non-tasters\n\nDuration: Pleas
 e allow 120 minutes for this experience
LOCATION:Cuvaison Experience Salon\, Outdoors Only
URL:https://tewines.com/pages/cuvaison-tastings 
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
